{"seq":3,"slug":"embedded-and-nostd","title":"嵌入式与 no_std","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/systems-programming/embedded-and-nostd","wordCount":738,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"嵌入式与-no_std\">嵌入式与 no_std</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>#![no_std]</code> 让 Rust 脱离操作系统运行：只依赖 <code>core</code>（甚至可选的 <code>alloc</code>）。理解本篇的关键，是把它看成一次<strong>依赖面的收窄</strong>——失去的不是语言能力，而是那些预设了操作系统存在的设施（文件 I/O、线程、<code>println!</code>、全局堆），因此每个被去掉的能力都需要由平台、HAL 或你自行补齐。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三层结构清晰可辨</strong>：<code>core</code> 无条件可用，<code>alloc</code> 需要全局分配器，<code>std</code> 需要操作系统。</li>\n<li><strong>入口与 panic 必须自备</strong>：裸机环境没有操作系统替你启动和兜底，<code>_start</code> 与 <code>#[panic_handler]</code> 是程序成立的前提。</li>\n<li><strong><code>embedded-hal</code> 是可移植性的关键</strong>：以 trait 描述外设能力，驱动代码即可跨芯片复用，这是 Rust 嵌入式生态的核心抽象。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"什么是-no_std\">什么是 no_std</h2><p><code>#![no_std]</code> 属性告诉编译器不链接标准库（<code>std</code>），只使用核心库（<code>core</code>）和可选的 <code>alloc</code>。这使得 Rust 可以在没有操作系统、没有堆分配的裸机环境中运行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;std 标准库&quot;] --&gt;|包含| B[&quot;alloc 堆分配&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|包含| C[&quot;core 核心库&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|包含| C&#10;    D[&quot;no_std 环境&quot;] --&gt;|可用| C&#10;    D --&gt;|可选| B\">graph TD\n    A[\"std 标准库\"] --&gt;|包含| B[\"alloc 堆分配\"]\n    A --&gt;|包含| C[\"core 核心库\"]\n    B --&gt;|包含| C\n    D[\"no_std 环境\"] --&gt;|可用| C\n    D --&gt;|可选| B</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>库层级</th>\n<th>提供内容</th>\n<th>需要条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>core</code></td>\n<td>基本类型、Iterator、Option、Result</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>alloc</code></td>\n<td><code>Vec</code>、<code>String</code>、<code>Box</code>、<code>Rc</code></td>\n<td>全局分配器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>std</code></td>\n<td>文件 I/O、网络、线程、<code>println!</code></td>\n<td>操作系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"最小化-no_std-程序\">最小化 no_std 程序</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#![no_std]&#10;#![no_main]&#10;&#10;use core::panic::PanicInfo;&#10;&#10;#[panic_handler]&#10;fn panic(_info: &amp;PanicInfo) -&gt; ! {&#10;    loop {}&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[no_mangle]&#10;pub extern &quot;C&quot; fn _start() -&gt; ! {&#10;    loop {}&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#![no_std]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#![no_main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use core::panic::PanicInfo;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[panic_handler]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn panic(_info: &#x26;PanicInfo) -> ! {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loop {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[no_mangle]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub extern \"C\" fn _start() -> ! {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loop {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>必须提供的组件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>标注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>#[panic_handler]</code></td>\n<td>定义 panic 时的行为</td>\n<td>必须，返回 <code>!</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#[no_mangle] _start</code></td>\n<td>入口点</td>\n<td>替代 <code>main</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#![no_main]</code></td>\n<td>不使用标准 main 入口</td>\n<td>与 <code>_start</code> 配合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"embedded-hal-抽象层\">embedded-hal 抽象层</h2><p><code>embedded-hal</code> 为嵌入式外设定义了统一的 trait 接口，使驱动代码可以跨硬件平台复用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use embedded_hal::digital::OutputPin;&#10;&#10;struct Led&lt;P: OutputPin&gt; {&#10;    pin: P,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;P: OutputPin&gt; Led&lt;P&gt; {&#10;    fn new(pin: P) -&gt; Self {&#10;        Led { pin }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn on(&amp;mut self) {&#10;        self.pin.set_high().ok();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn off(&amp;mut self) {&#10;        self.pin.set_low().ok();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn toggle(&amp;mut self, state: bool) {&#10;        if state {&#10;            self.on();&#10;        } else {&#10;            self.off();&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use embedded_hal::digital::OutputPin;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Led&#x3C;P: OutputPin> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pin: P,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;P: OutputPin> Led&#x3C;P> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn new(pin: P) -> Self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Led { pin }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn on(&#x26;mut self) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.pin.set_high().ok();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn off(&#x26;mut self) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.pin.set_low().ok();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn toggle(&#x26;mut self, state: bool) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if state {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            self.on();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            self.off();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"常用嵌入式-crate\">常用嵌入式 Crate</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Crate</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>层级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>cortex-m</code></td>\n<td>ARM Cortex-M 处理器底层支持</td>\n<td>架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cortex-m-rt</code></td>\n<td>启动代码和中断向量表</td>\n<td>运行时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>embedded-hal</code></td>\n<td>硬件抽象层 trait</td>\n<td>抽象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>stm32f4xx-hal</code></td>\n<td>STM32F4 具体 HAL 实现</td>\n<td>HAL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rtic</code></td>\n<td>实时中断驱动并发框架</td>\n<td>框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>defmt</code></td>\n<td>高效的嵌入式日志框架</td>\n<td>工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>heapless</code></td>\n<td>无堆分配的数据结构</td>\n<td>数据结构</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"heapless-无堆数据结构\">heapless：无堆数据结构</h2><p>在没有堆分配的环境中，<code>heapless</code> 提供了栈上固定容量的集合。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use heapless::Vec;&#10;use heapless::String;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let mut buf: Vec&lt;u8, 64&gt; = Vec::new();&#10;    buf.push(1).unwrap();&#10;    buf.push(2).unwrap();&#10;    buf.push(3).unwrap();&#10;&#10;    let mut s: String&lt;128&gt; = String::new();&#10;    core::fmt::write(&amp;mut s, format_args!(&quot;温度: {}°C&quot;, 25)).unwrap();&#10;&#10;    assert_eq!(buf.len(), 3);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use heapless::Vec;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use heapless::String;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut buf: Vec&#x3C;u8, 64> = Vec::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    buf.push(1).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    buf.push(2).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    buf.push(3).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut s: String&#x3C;128> = String::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    core::fmt::write(&#x26;mut s, format_args!(\"温度: {}°C\", 25)).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assert_eq!(buf.len(), 3);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>heapless 类型</th>\n<th>对应 std 类型</th>\n<th>特性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Vec&lt;T, N&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Vec&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>栈上固定容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>String&lt;N&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>String</code></td>\n<td>栈上固定容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>LinearMap&lt;K, V, N&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>HashMap</code></td>\n<td>线性查找</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>FnvIndexMap&lt;K, V, N&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>HashMap</code></td>\n<td>FNV 哈希</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"中断与-rtic\">中断与 RTIC</h2><p>RTIC（Real-Time Interrupt-driven Concurrency）是 Rust 嵌入式领域的实时并发框架。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[rtic::app(device = stm32f4xx_hal::pac, dispatchers = [USART1])]&#10;mod app {&#10;    use stm32f4xx_hal::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;    #[shared]&#10;    struct Shared {&#10;        counter: u32,&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    #[local]&#10;    struct Local {}&#10;&#10;    #[init]&#10;    fn init(cx: init::Context) -&gt; (Shared, Local) {&#10;        (Shared { counter: 0 }, Local {})&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    #[task(shared = [counter])]&#10;    async fn update(mut cx: update::Context) {&#10;        cx.shared.counter.lock(|c| {&#10;            *c += 1;&#10;        });&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[rtic::app(device = stm32f4xx_hal::pac, dispatchers = [USART1])]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mod app {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use stm32f4xx_hal::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[shared]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    struct Shared {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        counter: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[local]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    struct Local {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[init]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn init(cx: init::Context) -> (Shared, Local) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (Shared { counter: 0 }, Local {})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[task(shared = [counter])]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async fn update(mut cx: update::Context) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cx.shared.counter.lock(|c| {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            *c += 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"交叉编译\">交叉编译</h2><p>嵌入式开发需要交叉编译到目标架构。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 添加目标平台&#10;rustup target add thumbv7em-none-eabihf&#10;&#10;# 编译&#10;cargo build --target thumbv7em-none-eabihf --release&#10;&#10;# 烧录（使用 probe-rs）&#10;cargo flash --chip STM32F411CEUx --release\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 添加目标平台</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rustup</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> thumbv7em-none-eabihf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 编译</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> thumbv7em-none-eabihf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 烧录（使用 probe-rs）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> flash</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --chip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> STM32F411CEUx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常见嵌入式目标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Target</th>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>典型芯片</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>thumbv6m-none-eabi</code></td>\n<td>Cortex-M0/M0+</td>\n<td>RP2040, STM32F0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>thumbv7em-none-eabihf</code></td>\n<td>Cortex-M4F/M7</td>\n<td>STM32F4, nRF52</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>riscv32imc-unknown-none-elf</code></td>\n<td>RISC-V</td>\n<td>ESP32-C3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>aarch64-unknown-none</code></td>\n<td>AArch64 裸机</td>\n<td>Raspberry Pi</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"no_std-与-std-兼容库\">no_std 与 std 兼容库</h2><p>编写同时支持 <code>no_std</code> 和 <code>std</code> 的库：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#![cfg_attr(not(feature = &quot;std&quot;), no_std)]&#10;&#10;#[cfg(feature = &quot;alloc&quot;)]&#10;extern crate alloc;&#10;&#10;#[cfg(feature = &quot;alloc&quot;)]&#10;use alloc::vec::Vec;&#10;&#10;pub fn sum(data: &amp;[i32]) -&gt; i32 {&#10;    data.iter().sum()&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[cfg(feature = &quot;alloc&quot;)]&#10;pub fn collect_even(data: &amp;[i32]) -&gt; Vec&lt;i32&gt; {&#10;    data.iter().filter(|&amp;&amp;x| x % 2 == 0).copied().collect()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#![cfg_attr(not(feature = \"std\"), no_std)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(feature = \"alloc\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>extern crate alloc;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(feature = \"alloc\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use alloc::vec::Vec;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn sum(data: &#x26;[i32]) -> i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data.iter().sum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(feature = \"alloc\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn collect_even(data: &#x26;[i32]) -> Vec&#x3C;i32> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data.iter().filter(|&#x26;&#x26;x| x % 2 == 0).copied().collect()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# Cargo.toml&#10;[features]&#10;default = [&quot;std&quot;]&#10;std = [&quot;alloc&quot;]&#10;alloc = []\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[features]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>default = [\"std\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>std = [\"alloc\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alloc = []</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>#![no_std]</code> 只依赖 <code>core</code> 与可选的 <code>alloc</code>，使 Rust 可运行于裸机与无操作系统环境。</li>\n<li>裸机程序必须自备入口点（<code>_start</code>）与 panic 处理器，并声明 <code>#![no_main]</code>。</li>\n<li><code>embedded-hal</code> 用 trait 抽象外设，让驱动代码跨芯片复用；<code>heapless</code> 提供栈上固定容量的集合替代堆分配类型。</li>\n<li>RTIC 等框架把中断优先级转化为编译期检查的共享资源访问规则，实现无数据竞争的实时并发。</li>\n<li>通过 <code>#![cfg_attr(not(feature = &quot;std&quot;), no_std)]</code> 与 feature 门控，可让同一份代码同时支持 <code>std</code> 与 <code>no_std</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"嵌入式与 no_std","id":"嵌入式与-no_std"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是 no_std","id":"什么是-no_std"},{"level":2,"text":"最小化 no_std 程序","id":"最小化-no_std-程序"},{"level":2,"text":"embedded-hal 抽象层","id":"embedded-hal-抽象层"},{"level":2,"text":"常用嵌入式 Crate","id":"常用嵌入式-crate"},{"level":2,"text":"heapless：无堆数据结构","id":"heapless-无堆数据结构"},{"level":2,"text":"中断与 RTIC","id":"中断与-rtic"},{"level":2,"text":"交叉编译","id":"交叉编译"},{"level":2,"text":"no_std 与 std 兼容库","id":"no_std-与-std-兼容库"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"内存布局与零成本抽象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/systems-programming/memory-layout"},"next":{"title":"性能优化与基准测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/systems-programming/performance-benchmarking"}}